# q6: skipped - heap_paths also returns the candidates left on Yen's heap, and which candidates are left depends on the order the edges are fetched in (the same query with the edges in reverse id order returns another set), so upstream's own answer is one of several; the first K paths still match upstream, and test/sql/ksp.test covers heap_paths

